OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1790708176
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANo 'deliberate' contact to stop car in
OL,4,AA66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe initial investigation by the
OL,7,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,8,F(IOPC) said there was no evidence
OL,9,Fpolice had initiated contact with the
OL,10,FPassat.
OL,12,FHowever, director of engagement, Emily
OL,13,FBarry, said it will take the IOPC
OL,14,Fmonths to conclude its full
OL,15,Finvestigation due to the amount of
OL,16,Finformation to review.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
